             1      6
o7 : Matrix R  <-- R, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i8 : selectInSubring(2, gens gb I);

             1      5
o8 : Matrix R  <-- R, class => language-macaulay2}}}}, TR{TD{PRE{CODE{i9 : selectInSubring(3, gens gb I);

             1      3
o9 : Matrix R  <-- R, class => language-macaulay2}}}}}}, DIV{HEADER2{Caveat}, If the number of degree vectors is greater than one, this is currently only graded using the first degree vector.  This will eventually change.}, DIV{HEADER2{See also}, UL{LI{TOH{Macaulay2Doc :: Weights}}, LI{TOH{Macaulay2Doc :: definition of product (block) orders}}, LI{TOH{Macaulay2Doc :: selectInSubring}}}}, DIV{DIV{class => waystouse}, DIV{class => waystouse, HEADER2{For the programmer}, PARA{The object , TO{Macaulay2Doc :: Eliminate},  is , SPAN{a , TO2{Macaulay2Doc :: SelfInitializingType, self initializing type}}, , with ancestor classes , TO{Macaulay2Doc :: BasicList},  < , TO{Macaulay2Doc :: Thing}, .}}, HR{}, DIV{class => waystouse, PARA{The source of this document is in , TT{Macaulay2Doc/ov_monomial_orderings.m2:557:0}, .}}}}

